OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto Edinburgh basement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been charged over a road
OL,7,Ftraffic offence after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto an Edinburgh basement.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Rutland Square at
OL,11,Fabout 13:35 and the female driver was
OL,12,Ftaken to hospital to be checked over.
OL,14,FVideo footage of the incident showed a
OL,15,Ftow truck lifting the car up into the
OL,16,Fair from the basement level of the
OL,17,Fbuilding, supervised by police
OL,18,Fofficers.
OL,20,FA report will be submitted to the
OL,21,Fprocurator fiscal.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
